 "id": "240-19",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Starting a new job can be daunting, but I'm here to help you navigate through it all.",
  "Now, one of the first things I want to impress upon you is the importance of good note-taking habits.",
  "Actually, Marta, I want you to avoid using a physical notebook altogether.",
  "While it might seem like a good idea, notebooks can easily get lost, damaged, or become cumbersome to carry around.",
  "Instead, I'd like you to utilize digital tools for note-taking.",
  "First and foremost, I want you to become familiar with using a simple text editor for your notes.",
  "That way, you can easily locate and refer back to specific sets of notes without having to scroll through a massive document.",
  "You can have a main folder for all your work-related notes, and then create subfolders within it to categorize your notes further.",
  "The structure is entirely up to you and how you work best.",
  "One advantage is the ability to quickly copy and paste code snippets or commands from your notes into your integrated development environment (IDE).",
  "Also, don't hesitate to reach out to our HR team if you have any specific questions or concerns.",
  "They can provide additional guidance and help clarify any benefits-related queries.",
  "Also, remember to always use annotations for your methods.",
  "Clear and descriptive annotations are crucial for maintaining readable and understandable code, especially in a collaborative environment like ours.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "Remember, every small action adds up.",
  "Absolutely, and I'm here to support you in that journey.",
  "It's important that we maintain consistency and follow certain naming conventions."
 ],
